That made me laugh so hard.

987
00:45:37.050 --> 00:45:41.890
He said he watched Cookie Monster Sings Chocolate Rain about a thousand times.

988
00:45:42.110 --> 00:45:43.310
Did you go watch it?

989
00:45:43.690 --> 00:45:44.610
I had to know.

990
00:45:44.810 --> 00:45:45.330
Of course.

991
00:45:45.690 --> 00:45:46.530
Here's the thing.

992
00:45:46.750 --> 00:45:46.870
What?

993
00:45:46.870 --> 00:45:54.670
Chocolate Rain, according to its Wikipedia page, was a song by American singer Tay Zonday.

994
00:45:54.850 --> 00:45:56.590
I went and watched Tay's last night.

995
00:45:56.950 --> 00:45:57.690
Oh, you did?

996
00:45:57.830 --> 00:45:58.110
I did.

997
00:45:58.210 --> 00:45:59.350
You watched it as well.

998
00:45:59.450 --> 00:45:59.690
Yeah.

999
00:46:00.150 --> 00:46:00.530
